    'we advise you apply well in advance of the admission deadline date to allow for sufficient processing time. immigration, refugees and citizenship canada (ircc) provides information about' => '十分な処理時間を可能にするために、入場期限の前によく申し込んでください。移民、難民と市民権カナダ',
